id: 14
hanzi: 总裁
pinyin: zǒng cái
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: president (of a corporation); CEO; director-general
  es: presidente ejecutivo; director general; CEO de empresa corporativa

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | the highest executive officer or president managing the operations of a large corporation, conglomerate, or international financial institution | máximo responsable ejecutivo o presidente con mando supremo en una corporación, consorcio o banco | 执行总裁 (chief executive officer / CEO)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 在微信国际化战略研讨会上，腾讯公司总裁发表了关于打造全球移动互联生态圈的主题演讲。 | Zài Wēixìn guójìhuà zhànlüè yántǎohuì shàng, Téngxùn gōngsī zǒngcái fābiǎole guānyú dǎzào quánqiú yídòng hùlián shēngtàiquān de zhǔtí yǎnjiǎng. | At the WeChat globalization seminar, the president of Tencent delivered a keynote address on building a worldwide mobile internet ecosystem. | En las jornadas de internacionalización de WeChat, el presidente de Tencent pronunció un discurso magistral sobre el ecosistema móvil global.
  #2 | 跨国银行新任总裁雷厉风行地启动了组织架构改革，旨在全面提升数字化金融服务的响应速度。 | Kuàguó yínháng xīnrèn zǒngcái léilì-fēngxíng de qǐdòngle zǔzhī jiàgòu gǎigé, zhǐzài quánmiàn tíshēng shùzìhuà jīnróng fúwù de xiǎngyìng sùdù. | The multinational bank's new president swiftly initiated an organizational restructure aiming to elevate the responsiveness of digital financial services. | El nuevo presidente ejecutivo del banco internacional acometió con pulso firme una reforma organizativa para agilizar la banca digital.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  执行总裁 | Chief Executive Officer (CEO)
  副总裁 | Vice President (VP)
